{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Whatever you uncover, whatever you choose to remember...</i></strong><br><strong>know that I have always loved you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Even when I couldn\u2019t say it. </i> </strong><br><strong><i>And above all, remember...You will never be alone.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/5c12bc6203deb292ce5d56e21a3c8505.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/5c12bc6203deb292ce5d56e21a3c8505.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/5c12bc6203deb292ce5d56e21a3c8505.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island. A suitcase. A letter.  <br>Ethan is in his early twenties when he inherits all this from his late grandfather. He lives alone, his relationship with his mother is distant, and the memories of the island and of the man he once called &quot;grandpa&quot; are hazy, buried under something he can\u2019t quite grasp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the letter, an invitation: to return to the island.<br>Perhaps there, he\u2019ll find answers. Perhaps he\u2019ll remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Lighthouse Tale</strong> is a first-person narrative adventure set on a solitary island, dominated by an old lighthouse and steeped in forgotten memories. Explore the places from Ethan\u2019s childhood, observe, listen, reconstruct. Uncover the secrets the island holds, and the reason why his grandfather was so determined for him to come back, and what, exactly, he wanted him to find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/4ef7a7c838180d892cf17160d0a5dfea.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/4ef7a7c838180d892cf17160d0a5dfea.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/4ef7a7c838180d892cf17160d0a5dfea.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deeply personal narrative experience:</strong><br>Immerse yourself in an intimate and emotional story, filled with fragmented memories, long-lost feelings, and broken family ties. Accompanied only by nature, silence, and your will to remember, you\u2019ll embark on a profound inner journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/c92746e9146d17dc537c9e15a80b9b51.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/c92746e9146d17dc537c9e15a80b9b51.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/c92746e9146d17dc537c9e15a80b9b51.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An island full of history and meaning:</strong><br>Every corner of the island has a story to tell. Examine objects, browse old photos, and listen to echoes of the past. The island changes through time, just like Ethan\u2019s memories. Revisit it at different points in his life to see how it has evolved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/8966e8d2d3cc705257e81a9ba60cf9dd.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/8966e8d2d3cc705257e81a9ba60cf9dd.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/8966e8d2d3cc705257e81a9ba60cf9dd.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple puzzles, powerful emotions:</strong><br>Forget complex riddles: the challenges here are small but meaningful. A broken radio, a treasure hunt, an object to find. Every interaction is a chance to unlock a piece of the past, not a test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/f04efc39fa3363450721cb3fa1e9569d.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/f04efc39fa3363450721cb3fa1e9569d.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/f04efc39fa3363450721cb3fa1e9569d.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and hidden memories:</strong><br>Scattered across the island are hidden items tied to lost memories. Some belong to Ethan. Others, perhaps, to those who came before him. Find them all to complete the emotional puzzle of the story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782900?t=1758037258","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/707758945f91a1d46fbca65bee6c5761c6a82718/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758037258","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/6b2dfba7892b5a1856f708d02cbb11bea287bcca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758037258","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/6b2dfba7892b5a1856f708d02cbb11bea287bcca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758037258","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Whatever you uncover, whatever you choose to remember...</i></strong><br><strong>know that I have always loved you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Even when I couldn\u2019t say it. </i> </strong><br><strong><i>And above all, remember...You will never be alone.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/5c12bc6203deb292ce5d56e21a3c8505.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/5c12bc6203deb292ce5d56e21a3c8505.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared