 filled with fragmented memories, long-lost feelings, and broken family ties. Accompanied only by nature, silence, and your will to remember, you\u2019ll embark on a profound inner journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/c92746e9146d17dc537c9e15a80b9b51.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/c92746e9146d17dc537c9e15a80b9b51.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/c92746e9146d17dc537c9e15a80b9b51.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An island full of history and meaning:</strong><br>Every corner of the island has a story to tell. Examine objects, browse old photos, and listen to echoes of the past. The island changes through time, just like Ethan\u2019s memories. Revisit it at different points in his life to see how it has evolved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/8966e8d2d3cc705257e81a9ba60cf9dd.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/8966e8d2d3cc705257e81a9ba60cf9dd.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/8966e8d2d3cc705257e81a9ba60cf9dd.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple puzzles, powerful emotions:</strong><br>Forget complex riddles: the challenges here are small but meaningful. A broken radio, a treasure hunt, an object to find. Every interaction is a chance to unlock a piece of the past, not a test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/f04efc39fa3363450721cb3fa1e9569d.poster.avif?t=1758037258\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/f04efc39fa3363450721cb3fa1e9569d.webm?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/extras/f04efc39fa3363450721cb3fa1e9569d.mp4?t=1758037258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and hidden memories:</strong><br>Scattered across the island are hidden items tied to lost memories. Some belong to Ethan. Others, perhaps, to those who came before him. Find them all to complete the emotional puzzle of the story.</p>","developers":["2020LabStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782900/62a06827f2136627afc5b1aebb2cb385f977108e/header.jpg?t=1758037258","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2020LabStudio. All right reserved<br />\r\n<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"A Lighthouse Tale","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>